{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780014-do-you-switch-around-the-sidhe-houses","id":780014,"title":"Do you switch around the Sidhe Houses?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-04T12:07:27-08:00","id":780014,"title":"Do you switch around the Sidhe Houses?","content":"I do, yes, I give Ireland priority, but the lack of Persian and Greek houses annoys me. We are told the Greek gods are Sidhe in the Satyr Kithbook! So where is at least the Greek House? And given the Peri, where's the Persian Noble house?<br /> <br /> So I dump the dull house and add new houses.<br /> <br /> Which Sidhe house do you dump. And what new house do you add and why?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T13:00:46-08:00","id":780073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/780014-do-you-switch-around-the-sidhe-houses#post780014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do, yes, I give Ireland priority, but the lack of Persian and Greek houses annoys me. We are told the Greek gods are Sidhe in the Satyr Kithbook! So where is at least the Greek House? And given the Peri, where's the Persian Noble house?<br /> <br /> So I dump the dull house and add new houses.<br /> <br /> Which Sidhe house do you dump. And what new house do you add and why?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Alot of things claim to be the Greek Gods. Not many have much to back it up, Umbral Spirits probably pull it off the best. SInce there aren't Nunahei Sidhe I don't see why there should be Greek or Persian Sidhe, I'd personally limit the Houses to Irish, British, Welsh, Scottish, French and Spanish. The Greeks should have theirown Demigods claiming descent from Zeus, the persians should have all manner of Djinni court, the Sidhe should have Noble Peerage in other cultures.<br /> <br /> That being said I'd make Aesin and varich into the building blocks of theirown Kiths.<br /> <br /> I'd make House Balor House Lugh with &quot;Balor&quot; being a conspiriacy within the House rather than the entire house being a blatant conspiracy that everyone can look at.<br /> <br /> Leanhaun is just basically unplayably bad, their flaw is too extreme I am not sure what i'd replace it with though.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}